# Written by doc examples: the README and tutorial both open a SQLite database
# called `app.db`. It was committed by accident in 05c54aa when `git add -A`
# swept it up; tests/run_doc_examples.sh now runs blocks in a scratch
# directory, so it should never reappear -- this is the belt to that braces.
app.db
