# REAL BANK STATEMENTS -- a personal account, dropped here 2026-09-18 as the
# first non-synthetic corpus `ari` has ever been pointed at (limitation L0 in
# docs/ari_limitations.md). NEVER COMMITTED: they carry an account number, a
# balance history and a name. What may leave this directory is a FINDING --
# "this format writes a trailing CR", "this date form is unread" -- never a
# line of the file, and never a fixture derived from one without rewriting
# every figure and identifier in it.
examples/statements/

# Release artifacts built by tools/build-release-tarball.sh. Binaries do not
# belong in the repository: they are reproducible from a tag and the script,
# and committing them would grow history by a megabyte per release.
dist/
